{"timestamp":"2026-10-14T14:00:39.176Z","type":"tool","initiativeId":"agents-v1-decision-pool-goals--2026-10-14","step":"PLAN","details":{"toolName":"edit","args":{"path":"mdocs/initiatives/agents-v1-decision-pool-goals-2026-10-14--2026-10-14.md","oldString":"## Plan\n- [ ] Decision pool SavedData + schema v1\n- [ ] Task board with claim/complete/lease-expiry\n- [ ] Light + shelter comfort detectors\n- [ ] Gametests, review, validate\n\n## Progress Log\n- [2026-10-14T05:54:12.292Z] Created initiative via mdocs command","newString":"## Plan\nDesign source of truth: `reference/agent-embodiment-observation` (pillars 3+4); scope additions per SEQ-007. Decisions for v1: pool persisted as SavedData (NBT, per-entry `schema_version=1`); JSON mirror deferred. Detectors raise shared singleton deficit tasks; a deficit clearing auto-completes an open/claimed task and the deterministic evaluator records the outcome to the pool (failures stored as anti-patterns).\n\n- [ ] Decision pool SavedData + schema v1 — `content/agents/pool/AgentDecisionPool.java` + `PoolEntry.java`: versioned NBT, size cap + LRU eviction by `last_used`, tag-match top-K retrieval (K config), trusted-after-N-successes flag\n- [ ] Task board SavedData — `content/agents/tasks/TaskBoard.java` + `BoardTask.java`: OPEN/CLAIMED/DONE/FAILED, claim with game-time lease, lazy + periodic lease-expiry sweep, complete/fail hooks that feed the pool evaluator\n- [ ] Light + shelter comfort detectors — `content/agents/tasks/ComfortDetectors.java` (server tick, config-gated): light = spawnable-dark spots within player radius; shelter = at night, bed within radius AND skylight covered; raise/clear singleton deficit tasks per player key\n- [ ] Wire SavedData holders + detector tick in `SiasWorkshop.java`; all behavior config-gated (`Config.java` agents section: detectors on/interval/radius/thresholds, pool maxEntries/topK/trustThreshold)\n- [ ] SEQ-007: observation compression pass — token estimator (~chars/4), section caps + bottom-up trimming to a config token budget (default 900), compact POI/inventory formats in `AgentObservation`\n- [ ] SEQ-007: verbatim debug output — Agent Inspector writes the snapshot to `debug/siasworkshop/agent-observation-<timestamp>.txt` in the game dir (chat transcription is lossy)\n- [ ] Gametests (new `gametest/AgentsPoolGameTest.java`): pool save/load + retrieval + cap eviction; board claim/lease-expiry/singleton deficit; detectors raise+clear light and shelter; observation budget ≤900 with mock player\n- [ ] `./gradlew build` + `runGameTestServer` green, diff review, `mdocs validate`\n\n## Progress Log\n- [2026-10-14T05:54:12.292Z] Created initiative via mdocs command\n- [2026-10-14T14:05:00.000Z] Resumed in new session; prior session handed off via setup/session-recovery-2026-10-14 (spike committed as 8bfa3b8). Plan expanded with SEQ-007 scope (observation compression + budget gametest + verbatim snapshot-to-file)."}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-14T14:00:39.179Z","type":"tool","initiativeId":"agents-v1-decision-pool-goals--2026-10-14","step":"PLAN","details":{"toolName":"edit","args":{"path":"mdocs/initiatives/agents-v1-decision-pool-goals-2026-10-14--2026-10-14.md","oldString":"## Plan\n- [ ] Decision pool SavedData + schema v1\n- [ ] Task board with claim/complete/lease-expiry\n- [ ] Light + shelter comfort detectors\n- [ ] Gametests, review, validate\n\n## Progress Log\n- [2026-10-14T05:54:12.292Z] Created initiative via mdocs command","newString":"## Plan\nDesign source of truth: `reference/agent-embodiment-observation` (pillars 3+4); scope additions per SEQ-007. Decisions for v1: pool persisted as SavedData (NBT, per-entry `schema_version=1`); JSON mirror deferred. Detectors raise shared singleton deficit tasks; a deficit clearing auto-completes an open/claimed task and the deterministic evaluator records the outcome to the pool (failures stored as anti-patterns).\n\n- [ ] Decision pool SavedData + schema v1 — `content/agents/pool/AgentDecisionPool.java` + `PoolEntry.java`: versioned NBT, size cap + LRU eviction by `last_used`, tag-match top-K retrieval (K config), trusted-after-N-successes flag\n- [ ] Task board SavedData — `content/agents/tasks/TaskBoard.java` + `BoardTask.java`: OPEN/CLAIMED/DONE/FAILED, claim with game-time lease, lazy + periodic lease-expiry sweep, complete/fail hooks that feed the pool evaluator\n- [ ] Light + shelter comfort detectors — `content/agents/tasks/ComfortDetectors.java` (server tick, config-gated): light = spawnable-dark spots within player radius; shelter = at night, bed within radius AND skylight covered; raise/clear singleton deficit tasks per player key\n- [ ] Wire SavedData holders + detector tick in `SiasWorkshop.java`; all behavior config-gated (`Config.java` agents section: detectors on/interval/radius/thresholds, pool maxEntries/topK/trustThreshold)\n- [ ] SEQ-007: observation compression pass — token estimator (~chars/4), section caps +