nt-verified? lease cleared? no pool write?).\n6. **Config**: all new knobs ranged, defaults sane, comments accurate.\n7. **Test quality**: do the 9 new tests in AgentsLlmGameTest assert real behavior? Any tautologies? The poll-based loop tests — racy leftovers?\n8. Conventions: lang keys prefixed, init/ holders, no stray comments, javadoc on public API.\n\n## Report\n\nPer finding: severity (blocking / should-fix / nit), file:line, explanation, suggested fix. Overall verdict: APPROVE / APPROVE-WITH-NITS / REQUEST-CHANGES. Be specific and skeptical; if nothing blocking, say so explicitly after checking each focus area.","subagent_type":"plan"}}}
