{"timestamp":"2026-10-15T17:42:46.653Z","type":"tool","step":"PLAN","details":{"toolName":"bash","args":{"command":"git add src/main/java/com/siaws/siawsmod/config/Config.java src/main/java/com/siaws/siawsmod/content/agents/AgentDecisionLoop.java src/main/java/com/siaws/siawsmod/content/agents/build/BuildCommand.java src/main/java/com/siaws/siawsmod/content/llm/LlmActions.java src/main/java/com/siaws/siawsmod/content/llm/LlmClient.java src/main/java/com/siaws/siawsmod/content/llm/LlmPrompts.java src/main/java/com/siaws/siawsmod/gametest/AgentsLlmGameTest.java tools/gen_test_blueprint.py && git commit -m \"fix(agents): make LLM decision path work against LM Studio\n\nLive smoke test 3 found every LLM request silently falling back:\n- LM Studio (llama.cpp) rejects response_format \\\"json_object\\\" (HTTP 400;\n  only json_schema/text allowed), surfacing client-side as\n  ClosedChannelException. Drop response_format; the system prompt\n  constrains the shape, the parser stays defensive.\n- maxTokens 64 was consumed entirely by reasoning-model hidden thinking\n  (empty content, finish_reason=length) — default now 512.\n- parseJsonObject required content to start with '{'; bonsai-27b answers in\n  json code fences — extract the first {...} span instead.\n\nObservability (previously one DEBUG line on failure, silence on success):\n- INFO on LLM decisions and task claims, WARN with reason on fallback\n- /siasworkshop board dumps the shared task board in-game\n\nGametests 27/27 (new llmContentParsing + a response_format absence pin).\nAlso commit tools/gen_test_blueprint.py, the dev tool that generated the\nsmoke-test blueprint.\" && git log --oneline -1"}}}
