{"timestamp":"2026-10-16T17:07:39.828Z","type":"tool","step":"PLAN","details":{"toolName":"edit","args":{"newString":"<!-- Agents: append new entries below this line, in SEQ order. -->\n\n`SEQ-014 | 2026-10-16 | coordinator | RESOLVED | Cloud-model test round PASSED (OpenRouter, ~deepseek/deepseek-pro-latest; the ~ prefix is a valid OpenRouter id family — required, do not strip). Three findings: (1) trailing slash in llm.endpoint 404s — the client appends /chat/completions and OpenRouter does not normalize double slashes (verified /api/v1//models -> 404); fixed in config + client hardening (a322111). Diagnostic habit worth keeping: 401 vs 404 separated auth from path immediately. (2) Cloud decisions return in SECONDS (deepseek-pro does not burn reasoning tokens like bonsai-27b's 500-900) — prompt redesign validated: exact-key claims (decided via LLM: claim {\"task\":\"comfort:light:380df991-...\"}). Pipeline is now provably model-agnostic: same code ran LM Studio local and OpenRouter cloud. (3) Shelter ping-pong: the LLM correctly claims the night COMFORT_SHELTER task, but v1 has no shelter executor, so the claim is released and re-claimed every cycle — filtered COMFORT_SHELTER from the LLM-visible open list (same rule the fallback claimer already had) (3414e67). User has extensive gameplay feedback queued; next session: collect + prioritize. MCP initiative requirements input largely fulfilled by this round.`","oldString":"<!-- Agents: append new entries below this line, in SEQ order. -->","path":"mdocs/wiki/setup/agent-shared-ledger.md"}}}
