{"timestamp":"2026-10-17T07:25:04.654Z","type":"tool","initiativeId":"mcp-model-behavior-research--2026-10-15","step":"EXECUTE","details":{"toolName":"edit","args":{"newString":"    /** After this many cycles without meaningful movement, a claimed agent gives up (releases). */\n    private static final int STUCK_CYCLES = 40;\n    /** Executor releases suppress re-claims of the same task key for this long (game ticks). */\n    private static final int RELEASE_COOLDOWN_TICKS = 20 * 60 * 5;\n    /** Execution proceeds when the agent is within this distance of its target. */\n    private static final double ARRIVAL_DISTANCE = 2.0;\n\n    private static final AABB WHOLE_WORLD = new AABB(\n            -30_000_000, -4096, -30_000_000, 30_000_000, 4096, 30_000_000);\n\n    private static int ticksUntilRun;\n    private static final Set<UUID> inFlightRequests = new HashSet<>();\n    private static final Map<UUID, List<String>> pendingCitations = new HashMap<>();\n    private static final Map<UUID, int[]> lastPositions = new HashMap<>();\n    private static final Map<UUID, Integer> stuckCycles = new HashMap<>();\n    private static final Map<UUID, Map<String, Long>> releaseCooldowns = new HashMap<>();","oldString":"    /** After this many cycles without meaningful movement, a claimed agent gives up (releases). */\n    private static final int STUCK_CYCLES = 4;\n    /** Execution proceeds when the agent is within this distance of its target. */\n    private static final double ARRIVAL_DISTANCE = 2.0;\n\n    private static final AABB WHOLE_WORLD = new AABB(\n            -30_000_000, -4096, -30_000_000, 30_000_000, 4096, 30_000_000);\n\n    private static int ticksUntilRun;\n    private static final Set<UUID> inFlightRequests = new HashSet<>();\n    private static final Map<UUID, List<String>> pendingCitations = new HashMap<>();\n    private static final Map<UUID, int[]> lastPositions = new HashMap<>();\n    private static final Map<UUID, Integer> stuckCycles = new HashMap<>();","path":"src/main/java/com/siaws/siawsmod/content/agents/AgentDecisionLoop.java"}}}
