{"timestamp":"2026-10-17T07:30:15.360Z","type":"tool","initiativeId":"mcp-model-behavior-research--2026-10-15","step":"EXECUTE","details":{"toolName":"write","args":{"content":"fix(agents): S1 live-test findings — shelter leak, reject logging, stuck/cooldown\n\nLive run in TestSidecar01 (13 MCP decisions, zero transport failures,\nclean sidecar lifecycle) exposed four bugs the gametests could not:\n\n- COMFORT_SHELTER leaked into observe_board/claim: the exclusion lived\n  only in decide()'s private chain while openTasks()' javadoc claimed\n  it — the MCP model claimed shelter, the executor instantly released\n  it, and the loop template-fell-back (ping-pong). The exclusion now\n  lives in openTasks() itself; pinned by mcpShelterHiddenFromSurface.\n- sidecar reject payloads surfaced as decision \"unknown\" with empty\n  detail; {\"decision\":\"error\"} was a silent no-op cycle. Both now WARN\n  with the reason and fall back to templates.\n- STUCK_CYCLES 4 -> 40: four ticks is 0.2s of no movement — unroutable\n  anchors spun claim/stuck-release/re-claim, burning a model call per\n  lap.\n- executor releases now carry a 5-minute per-agent re-claim cooldown so\n  the model cannot instantly re-pick a task the executor just gave up\n  on.\n\nAlso: INFO log on successful sidecar spawn (pid + command).\n\n36/36 gametests green (SEQ-024).\n","path":".tmp/commit-msg.txt"}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-17T07:30:15.366Z","type":"tool","initiativeId":"mcp-model-behavior-research--2026-10-15","step":"EXECUTE","details":{"toolName":"write","args":{"content":"fix(agents): S1 live-test findings — shelter leak, reject logging, stuck/cooldown\n\nLive run in TestSidecar01 (13 MCP decisions, zero transport failures,\nclean sidecar lifecycle) exposed four bugs the gametests could not:\n\n- COMFORT_SHELTER leaked into observe_board/claim: the exclusion lived\n  only in decide()'s private chain while openTasks()' javadoc claimed\n  it — the MCP model claimed shelter, the executor instantly released\n  it, and the loop template-fell-back (ping-pong). The exclusion now\n  lives in openTasks() itself; pinned by mcpShelterHiddenFromSurface.\n- sidecar reject payloads surfaced as decision \"unknown\" with empty\n  detail; {\"decision\":\"error\"} was a silent no-op cycle. Both now WARN\n  with the reason and fall back to templates.\n- STUCK_CYCLES 4 -> 40: four ticks is 0.2s of no movement — unroutable\n  anchors spun claim/stuck-release/re-claim, burning a model call per\n  lap.\n- executor releases now carry a 5-minute per-agent re-claim cooldown so\n  the model cannot instantly re-pick a task the executor just gave up\n  on.\n\nAlso: INFO log on successful sidecar spawn (pid + command).\n\n36/36 gametests green (SEQ-024).\n","path":".tmp/commit-msg.txt"}}}
