{"timestamp":"2026-10-17T07:34:17.616Z","type":"tool","initiativeId":"mcp-model-behavior-research--2026-10-15","step":"EXECUTE","details":{"toolName":"edit","args":{"newString":"Gametests 35→36. FOLLOW-UP (same session, second commit): caught the MCP BYPASS of the cooldown by re-walking the flow — McpTools.claim uses openTasks() directly, so a cooled-down task stayed claimable via the sidecar and the spin would persist; fixed by threading the cooldown through the MCP surface: AgentDecisionLoop.inReleaseCooldown public, McpTools.claim filters cooled keys (explicit claim of one → reject \"cooling down\"), observe_board grew an optional agent arg that hides the caller's cooled tasks (sidecar.py passes it; catalog.py observe.board + the mod's tools/list descriptor updated; bridge test PASS, replays 20/20 + 3/3). NOT fixed (design, later initiative): model task-choice diversity (first-listed latch), observation ordering, LM Studio-side latency. The user's flat-ground task went unclaimed all session — retest with the cooldown should let the agent move past the unroutable anchor to reachable work.","oldString":"Gametests 35→36. NOT fixed (design, later initiative): model task-choice diversity (first-listed latch), observation ordering, LM Studio-side latency. The user's flat-ground task went unclaimed all session — retest with the cooldown should let the agent move past the unroutable anchor to reachable work.","path":"mdocs/wiki/setup/agent-shared-ledger.md"}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-17T07:34:17.629Z","type":"tool","initiativeId":"mcp-model-behavior-research--2026-10-15","step":"EXECUTE","details":{"toolName":"edit","args":{"newString":"Gametests 35→36. FOLLOW-UP (same session, second commit): caught the MCP BYPASS of the cooldown by re-walking the flow — McpTools.claim uses openTasks() directly, so a cooled-down task stayed claimable via the sidecar and the spin would persist; fixed by threading the cooldown through the MCP surface: AgentDecisionLoop.inReleaseCooldown public, McpTools.claim filters cooled keys (explicit claim of one → reject \"cooling down\"), observe_board grew an optional agent arg that hides the caller's cooled tasks (sidecar.py passes it; catalog.py observe.board + the mod's tools/list descriptor updated; bridge test PASS, replays 20/20 + 3/3). NOT fixed (design, later initiative): model task-choice diversity (first-listed latch), observation ordering, LM Studio-side latency. The user's flat-ground task went unclaimed all session — retest with the cooldown should let the agent move past the unroutable anchor to reachable work.","oldString":"Gametests 35→36. NOT fixed (design, later initiative): model task-choice diversity (first-listed latch), observation ordering, LM Studio-side latency. The user's flat-ground task went unclaimed all session — retest with the cooldown should let the agent move past the unroutable anchor to reachable work.","path":"mdocs/wiki/setup/agent-shared-ledger.md"}}}
