{"timestamp":"2026-10-17T07:35:20.319Z","type":"tool","initiativeId":"mcp-model-behavior-research--2026-10-15","step":"EXECUTE","details":{"toolName":"write","args":{"content":"fix(agents): close the MCP bypass of the release cooldown\n\nRe-walking the S1 decision flow after the live-fix commit caught that\nMcpTools.claim reads openTasks() directly, so a cooled-down task stayed\nclaimable through the sidecar — the claim/stuck-release spin around an\nunroutable anchor would have persisted, one bonsai lap per cycle.\n\nThe cooldown now threads through the whole MCP surface:\n- AgentDecisionLoop.inReleaseCooldown (public, lazy-expiring)\n- McpTools.claim filters cooled keys; an explicit claim of one rejects\n  with \"cooling down after a recent release\"\n- observe_board takes an optional agent arg and hides that agent's\n  cooled-down tasks, so the model stops re-picking them at the source\n  (sidecar.py passes it; catalog schema + mod tools/list descriptor\n  updated to match)\n\nVerified: bridge test PASS, replays 20/20 + 3/3, 36/36 gametests (SEQ-024 amended).\n","path":".tmp/commit-msg.txt"}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-17T07:35:20.325Z","type":"tool","initiativeId":"mcp-model-behavior-research--2026-10-15","step":"EXECUTE","details":{"toolName":"write","args":{"content":"fix(agents): close the MCP bypass of the release cooldown\n\nRe-walking the S1 decision flow after the live-fix commit caught that\nMcpTools.claim reads openTasks() directly, so a cooled-down task stayed\nclaimable through the sidecar — the claim/stuck-release spin around an\nunroutable anchor would have persisted, one bonsai lap per cycle.\n\nThe cooldown now threads through the whole MCP surface:\n- AgentDecisionLoop.inReleaseCooldown (public, lazy-expiring)\n- McpTools.claim filters cooled keys; an explicit claim of one rejects\n  with \"cooling down after a recent release\"\n- observe_board takes an optional agent arg and hides that agent's\n  cooled-down tasks, so the model stops re-picking them at the source\n  (sidecar.py passes it; catalog schema + mod tools/list descriptor\n  updated to match)\n\nVerified: bridge test PASS, replays 20/20 + 3/3, 36/36 gametests (SEQ-024 amended).\n","path":".tmp/commit-msg.txt"}}}
