orpus Q4 (4 failure-class scenarios, Player-1 scoring + JEVA metrics) + `probe_decision.py` for typed SystemOne endpoints. Typed decision models do NOT drop in (Tier-1, SEQ-032: kev-4b-ternary needs domain recalibration; jev-style-0.8B inverted) — LLM tier0 (bonsai-27b via sidecar) stays production. Decision record: `reference/mcp-migration-recommendation`; design: `reference/mcp-pattern-tree-design`; evidence: ledger SEQ-020..024, SEQ-026, SEQ-031..033.\"}]}\nEOF\n./node_modules/.bin/mdocs command wiki.ingest --json \"$(cat /tmp/ingest-graduate.json)\" 2>&1 | head -20","cwd":"/Users/bbaaxx/Code/projects/siasworkshop"}}}
