{"timestamp":"2026-10-20T18:35:01.866Z","type":"tool","initiativeId":"executor-wart-polish-impossible-task-timeout-no-progress-watchdog-multi-chest-withdrawonce-self-collision-guard","step":"PLAN","details":{"toolName":"edit","args":{"newString":" * <p>Executors (v1): COMFORT_LIGHT walks to the recomputed nearest dark spot and places one\n * torch per cycle from its own inventory; BUILD walks to the anchor, withdraws palette items\n * from chests near the anchor (every stocked chest counts until the palette is satisfied),\n * and places blocks. COMFORT_SHELTER is never claimed by the fallback (LLM or a later\n * initiative). Places only — agents never break player-placed blocks in v1.","oldString":" * <p>Executors (v1): COMFORT_LIGHT walks to the recomputed nearest dark spot and places one\n * torch per cycle from its own inventory; BUILD walks to the anchor, withdraws palette items\n * from a nearby chest (one chest visit per cycle), and places blocks. COMFORT_SHELTER is\n * never claimed by the fallback (LLM or a later initiative). Places only — agents never\n * break player-placed blocks in v1.","path":"src/main/java/com/siaws/siawsmod/content/agents/AgentDecisionLoop.java"}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-20T18:35:01.870Z","type":"tool","initiativeId":"executor-wart-polish-impossible-task-timeout-no-progress-watchdog-multi-chest-withdrawonce-self-collision-guard","step":"PLAN","details":{"toolName":"edit","args":{"newString":" * <p>Executors (v1): COMFORT_LIGHT walks to the recomputed nearest dark spot and places one\n * torch per cycle from its own inventory; BUILD walks to the anchor, withdraws palette items\n * from chests near the anchor (every stocked chest counts until the palette is satisfied),\n * and places blocks. COMFORT_SHELTER is never claimed by the fallback (LLM or a later\n * initiative). Places only — agents never break player-placed blocks in v1.","oldString":" * <p>Executors (v1): COMFORT_LIGHT walks to the recomputed nearest dark spot and places one\n * torch per cycle from its own inventory; BUILD walks to the anchor, withdraws palette items\n * from a nearby chest (one chest visit per cycle), and places blocks. COMFORT_SHELTER is\n * never claimed by the fallback (LLM or a later initiative). Places only — agents never\n * break player-placed blocks in v1.","path":"src/main/java/com/siaws/siawsmod/content/agents/AgentDecisionLoop.java"}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-20T18:35:15.617Z","type":"tool","initiativeId":"executor-wart-polish-impossible-task-timeout-no-progress-watchdog-multi-chest-withdrawonce-self-collision-guard","step":"PLAN","details":{"toolName":"edit","args":{"newString":" * <p>Guardrails: every placement must be within {@code agents.guardRadius} of the task anchor\n * and on the task's block whitelist (torch / blueprint palette); violations are skipped with\n * a WARN. Movement is real navigation ({@code moveTo} + {@code isDone}), no teleports; a\n * stuck agent (no progress toward its goal for {@value #STUCK_CYCLES} cycles — circling\n * counts as stuck, motion is not progress) releases its claim, and repeated unroutable\n * releases terminal-fail the task (see {@link TaskBoard#UNREACHABLE_RELEASE_THRESHOLD}).\n * Suffocating blocks are never placed into the agent's own cell, and a suffocating agent\n * bails out of its task.\n */","oldString":" * <p>Guardrails: every placement must be within {@code agents.guardRadius} of the task anchor\n * and on the task's block whitelist (torch / blueprint palette); violations are skipped with\n * a WARN. Movement is real navigation ({@code moveTo} + {@code isDone}), no teleports; a\n * stuck agent releases its claim after {@value #STUCK_CYCLES} unmoving cycles.\n */","path":"src/main/java/com/siaws/siawsmod/content/agents/AgentDecisionLoop.java"}}}
